# Decisions with reopen conditions (spec 1.2)
Four decisions a team writes down once and the tools read every time. A person sets the weights and scores; the tool only adds them up. Example data.

// perfil: lnd-1.1 · claves: es · ámbito: example · vistas sugeridas: web, tablero, fuente

---

@fuente f-interviews
titulo: Ten customer interviews, notes
url: https://example.org/interviews
fecha: 2026-10-12
@@

@fuente f-confidence-method
titulo: How the confidence of d-price was computed: 7 of 10 interviews chose one-time (0.7), set by a person
fecha: 2026-10-19
@@

@afirmacion c-one-time
texto: Seven of ten small teams prefer a one-time payment to a subscription.
fuente: f-interviews
certeza: Supuesto
@@

@decision d-price
pregunta: Which price model ships at launch?
opciones: One-time 89 · Monthly 9
criterio: Fits what customers said | 3 | 4 | 2
criterio: Predictable revenue | 2 | 2 | 4
criterio: Simple to explain | 1 | 4 | 3
elegida: One-time 89
puntaje: 18/30
candidatas: One-time 89 · Monthly 9
confianza: 0.7
estado: decidida
fecha: 2026-10-19
fuente: @(c-one-time) · @(f-confidence-method)
reabrir_si: fewer than 20 sales in the first 30 days after launch
@@

@decision d-memory-policy
pregunta: Which memory goes into the agent's context?
opciones: Rule-based ranking · Most recent first
criterio: Certainty (Verified 1, Assumed 0.5) | 4 | 5 | 2
criterio: Uses | 3 | 4 | 1
criterio: Recency | 2 | 3 | 5
criterio: Topic match (applies_to) | 1 | 4 | 2
elegida: Rule-based ranking
estado: decidida
fecha: 2026-10-20
reabrir_si: the memory-to-input ratio is above 0.5 for two weeks in a row
@@

@decision d-next-build
pregunta: What do we build first after the validator?
opciones: Context ranking · Import from chat history · Stale-memory report
criterio: Users asked for it | 3 | 5 | 3 | 2
criterio: Effort (5 = least) | 2 | 3 | 2 | 4
criterio: Unblocks the next stage | 2 | 5 | 2 | 1
estado: abierta
@@

@decision d-hosting
pregunta: Where does the public demo run after launch?
opciones: Static host · Own server · Both
candidatas: Static host · Own server
estado: abstenida
reabrir_si: we have one week of real traffic numbers after launch
@@

@tarea t-ranking
titulo: Context ranking with a token budget
estado: pendiente
prioridad: alta
depende: d-next-build
responsable: team
@@
